WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 6: Fun with Pictures

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Open the crayon box! Red, blue, yellow, and green. A simple line starts to move across the white paper—what will it become?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Draw a round blue circle. Add a wavy string at the bottom. Wow! It turns into a balloon floating high up into the clouds!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Take a sturdy brown square with four equal sides. Place a pointed yellow triangle on top. Look, we built a cosy home with a green door!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look around your room: a clock is a circle, a doorway is a rectangle, and a samosa is a triangle! Shapes are everywhere!

